<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AI JobCoach</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <main class="jobcoach-page">
        
        <section>
            <br>
            <h2 class="panel-title">Privacy</h2>
            <p>
                At AI JobCoach, we take your privacy seriously. We do not collect or store any personal information from our users. All data uploaded to our platform is processed in real-time and is not retained on our servers. We are committed to providing a safe and secure experience for all users.
            </p>
                       
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="panel-title">Data Usage</h2>
            <p>
                The documents you upload (resumes, cover letters, job descriptions) are used solely for the purpose of providing feedback and generating compatibility scores. We do not share your data with any third parties, and all processing is done using secure, industry-standard practices.
            </p>
        </section>

        

    </main>
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>